  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 16-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence using HfO2 and SiO2. Stack sequence: Air | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | Fused Silica. Initialize all 16 layer thicknesses with uniform random jitter of ±20% around quarter-wave optical thickness at 1350 nm reference wavelength (HfO2 ~155 nm physical, SiO2 ~230 nm physical based on typical indices). Apply gradient-based thickness optimization with bounds of ±35% from initial median thickness. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Compute mean transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and mean reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Total layer count fixed at 16 finite layers. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: reflection in 1000-1700 nm; transmission in 300-450 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30.",
